	(text "Arduino UNO R3 sockets (J1A=PWR, J1B=ANALOG, J1C=D0-D7, J1D=D8-SCL). Used: 5V(via JP1), GND, A2=BATT_SENSE, A4=SDA, A5=SCL, D3=PWMA, D8=BIN2, D9=AIN2, D10=OE, D11=PWMB, D12=AIN1, D13=BIN1. VIN not connected."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "99dd5c63-6a5f-4f04-b055-1550f54e302c")
	)
	(text "TB6612FNG module (SparkFun-style dual header). J2 signal row: PWMA,AIN2,AIN1,STBY,BIN1,BIN2,PWMB,GND. J2M power row: VM,VCC,GND,AO1,AO2,BO2,BO1,GND. STBY tied to +5V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 85 38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b0a9a7a3-54ff-4890-b049-c0a55aa9ca16")
	)
	(text "PCA9685 16-ch PWM servo board (Adafruit layout). J3 control: GND,OE,SCL,SDA,VCC,V+. J3PWM: CH0-CH8 used, CH9-15 NC. Servo V+/GND rails come from board +5V/GND, not through module."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 85 98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "324f1a6a-ab1d-47a5-89b0-d76d4373ebe9")
	)
	(text "Servo outputs J9-J15/J18/J19: pin order SIG / V+ / GND. J9=HEAD(CH0) J10=NECK_T(CH1) J11=NECK_B(CH2) J12=EYE_R(CH3) J13=EYE_L(CH4) J14=ARM_L(CH5) J15=ARM_R(CH6) J18=BRO_L(CH7) J19=BRO_R(CH8). J16: OLED GND,VCC,SCL,SDA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 140 18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7bf5b044-c6ef-473b-9604-1b9e2f52a2ed")
	)
	(text "Power chain: J6 (3S LiPo in) -> F1 (10A fuse) -> SW1 (external rocker switch) -> +BATT rail -> J4 (buck in) / TB6612 VM / R1 divider. J5 (buck 5V out) -> +5V rail -> PCA9685 V+/VCC, 9x servo V+, TB6612 VCC+STBY, J17 (RPi 5V), OLED, LED via R3, JP1 (optional 5V to Arduino, default open = Arduino powered by USB only)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 180 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "dfea76c8-53be-4a44-b85e-f84a9c5d001f")
	)
	(text "J7 = left drive motor (AO1/AO2), J8 = right drive motor (BO1/BO2), 12V from TB6612 outputs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190 70 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9790bb34-58a8-4385-995e-d11a893c1683")
	)
	(text "Battery sense divider: R1=100k (+BATT), R2=47k (GND) -> BATT_SENSE to Arduino A2. 12.6V full -> ~4.03V at A2. R3=1k + D1 = +5V power indicator."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 70 210 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d63b65af-2d7c-4cbc-8809-a6acd9c3cc6a")
	)
